	Fake an Egg Hub (Retaliation Steal & Anti-Detect Edition)
	---------------------------------------------------------
	Egg farming, revenge pet stealing, rebirth and fake-egg ESP:

	  1. Farm   - buys the best egg (Tween/Instant), carries it home, hatches it
	  2. Steal  - detects when stolen from, infiltrates the thief base, picks best pet, instant 'E' steal, returns home
	  3. Auto   - rebirth, pen upgrade, disguise, equip best
	  4. ESP    - highlights the players hiding as eggs

	RightControl shows or hides the window. The language switches in Settings.
]]

